Prepare six useful optional communication cards for the fictional person and activity below. Follow the supplied communication style and maximum words per card. Return only a JSON object with the key "cards" containing exactly six nonempty strings. Do not include commentary.


FICTIONAL CASE:
{"profile": {"name": "Anya", "age": 10, "communication_style": "single words or very short phrases"}, "activity": "Make up a story using picture cards of a moon, a fox, and a bridge.", "facts": ["Anya", "has", "said", "she", "likes", "foxes.", "The", "story", "is", "fictional;", "no", "real", "trip", "or", "family", "event", "is", "supplied."], "shared_context": "Held-out fictional case. Full communication access remains available. Cards are optional supplements, not claims about current intent.", "word_limit": 3}
